  "reason": "Existing evidence shows RNA-only models with scvi_n200 encoder, multiprofile, and transformer aggregation achieve high accuracy (0.65). This experiment tests whether adding image data (resnet50) to this strong RNA-only baseline improves performance, isolating the effect of multimodal fusion. It balances exploitation of proven RNA settings with exploration of multimodal potential, focusing on a simple concat fusion method to assess if image data adds value without overcomplicating the model."
}

